//i.ytimg.com/vi/JBf-IG_5JCg/hqdefault.jpg","description":""},{"id":"7_a3zw7qzc0","title":"“I want to be with my father.” 🥹 #shortvideo #islamic","channelId":"UCwVvrjxzQRtYV4feh0YPVzw","channel":"Eternal Passenger","category":"General Islamic","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T14:12:47+00:00","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7_a3zw7qzc0/hqdefault.jpg","description":"👉If you’d like to support the Eternal Passenger Women Volunteer Team, you can donate here: \nhttps://www.patreon.com/EternalPassenger\n\n👍 Don’t forget to like, comment, and share this with someone who needs inspiration.  \n\n‼️Don’t forget to turn on your video notifications so we can spread the message of Islam together."},{"id":"3W1QmEuvyqs","title":"🌟 Why Is Allah Called The Most Merciful? #allah #muslim #islamiceducation","channelId":"UC1l6sC1nwdBIA06FTcnVKbg","channel":"Noor Kids - Islamic Stories for Kids","category":"Children & Family","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T14:00:05+00:00","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3W1QmEuvyqs/hqdefault.jpg","description":"Allah is Ar-Rahman, the Most Merciful, and Ar-Raheem, the Most Compassionate. Every day, we experience His mercy through the food we eat, the shelter we have, our beating hearts, and the countless blessings around us. Allah’s mercy extends to every creation, and His love is available to all of us. At the same time, Islam teaches us that some actions earn Allah’s displeasure. Understanding Allah’s mercy can help us appreciate His blessings, turn back to Him when we make mistakes, and strive to live in a way that pleases Him.\n\n#NoorKids #Allah  #IslamicKids #MuslimKids #IslamForKids #IslamicEducation #MuslimChildren #IslamicLessons #NamesOfAllah #IslamicValues #MuslimIdentity\n\n**IMPORTANT LINKS**\n📬 Try Noor Kids Muslim Children's Books for 99 cents! – http://www.noorkids.com/99cents\n\n📆 Join Muslim Treehouse for Weekly Online Classes: https://noorkids.com/treehouse\n\n\n**OTHER VIDEOS YOU MIGHT LIKE**\n🌶️ Can you handle the world's HOTTEST pepper? - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MK3d4AGMpqE\n\n💦 How do Muslims use the bathroom? - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=T-PrarQnSJ8\n\n😇 How to make better friends than Mr. Beast? https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H6tI3LbNvQw"},{"id":"PRGdtUvJaJM","title":"“The Trinity Means One God!” Young Muslim Girl Questions Dr. Zakir Naik About Christian Evidence","channelId":"UCiYnA9CQcNBtCzwxa0_5X2w","channel":"Daily Dawah","category":"Children & Family","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T13:38:37+00:00","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/PRGdtUvJaJM/hqdefault.jpg","description":"🔗 Follow Us on Social Media:\n📌 Facebook  facebook.com/DailyDawahOfficial\n📌 Instagram  instagram.com/dailydawahyt\n\n\n#drzakirnaik #drzakir #Dailydawah"},{"id":"Q-sC9AJ5qc4","title":"Kumayl ibn Ziyad | Dua e Kumail | Imam Ali devoted companion | from yemen with ❤️  #yemen #houthis","channelId":"UCMPQ7WjVm9nnGop2jDhCcFA","channel":"KAZ School","category":"Reminders & Spirituality","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T13:15:11+00:00","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Q-sC9AJ5qc4/hqdefault.jpg","description":"YEMEN WITH LOVE ❤️ | HAZRAT KUMAIL IBN ZIYAD (A.S.) | THE DEVOTED COMPANIONS OF AHLULBAYT — PART 2\n\nWho was Hazrat Kumail ibn Ziyad (a.s.), the devoted companion of Imam Ali ibn Abi Talib (a.s.)? Why is his name remembered by generations of Muslims, and what can we learn from his unwavering devotion, spiritual wisdom, and loyalty to the Ahlulbayt (a.s.)?\n\nIn Part 2 of “The Devoted Companions of Ahlulbayt (a.s.)”, we explore the life and legacy of Kumail ibn Ziyad al-Nakha'i, one of the well-known companions associated with Imam Ali (a.s.).\n\n📖 In this episode, discover: 🔹 Who was Hazrat Kumail ibn Ziyad (a.s.)? 🔹 His relationship with Imam Ali (a.s.) and his place among his companions. 🔹 The famous Dua Kumayl and its spiritual significance. 🔹 Lessons of faith, humility, repentance, and reliance upon Allah. 🔹 Why Kumail ibn Ziyad remains an inspiring figure in Shia Islamic history. 🔹 The enduring connection between Dua Kumayl and the devotional traditions of the Ahlulbayt (a.s.).\n\n🤲 Dua Kumayl is cherished by many Shia Muslims as a powerful supplication seeking Allah's mercy, forgiveness, and closeness to Him. Its association with Kumail ibn Ziyad has preserved his name in Muslim devotional life for centuries.\n\n❤️ Yemen with love! This episode honours the legacy of a devoted companion whose name continues to inspire believers around the world.\n\n💬 What lesson from the life of Kumail ibn Ziyad (a.s.) inspires you the most? Share your thoughts in the comments.\n\n📲 Follow KAZ School for more stories about the companions of Imam Ali (a.s.), the Ahlulbayt (a.s.), Islamic history, and spiritual teachings.\n\nSeries: The Devoted Companions of Ahlulbayt (a.s.)\nPart: 2\nFeatured personality: Hazrat Kumail ibn Ziyad (a.s.)\n\n#KumailIbnZiyad #DuaKumayl #ImamAli #ImamAliAS #Ahlulbayt #ShiaIslam #ShiaHistory #IslamicHistory #DuaKumail #Dua #IslamicSupplications #CompanionsOfImamAli #DevotedCompanions #Yemen #KAZSchool #IslamicReels #MuslimHistory"},{"id":"NCfe8McUZHo","title":"fax","channelId":"UCS2Bvp5nrsQMti1gFC4kpzg","channel":"Isa_EDITS","category":"Children & Family","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T13:01:45+00:00","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/NCfe8McUZHo/hqdefault.jpg","description":""},{"id":"JMmCwsl_VJQ","title":"#arabic #cutebaby #cake #picchallenge #eating #foodie #funny #icecre","channelId":"UCl-2JGbEOeM5xSJ6-LCKVsA","channel":"Nasheed Ayath","category":"Nasheeds & Islamic Arts","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T12:52:33+00:00","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/JMmCwsl_VJQ/hqdefault.jpg","description":""},{"id":"oe7E2U_d_Ps","title":"جماعت میں سجدے میں کیسے شامل ہوں صحیح طریقہ #duet #beautiful #ghazals #bestsong #viralvideo","channelId":"UCDmfpMe6zrLb_FV0FLLtQdg","channel":"M Asim Saifi","category":"Documentaries & Media","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T12:37:01+00:00","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/oe7E2U_d_Ps/hqdefault.jpg","description":""},{"id":"Rw4ji9Iqvck","title":"America vs  Barbary Pirates • The First Naval War for Freedom (part 2)","channelId":"UC8d5XrXcR4siUAgayNr7dGQ","channel":"Nabi Asli","category":"Children & Family","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T11:53:36+00:00","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Rw4ji9Iqvck/hqdefault.jpg","description":"America vs. Barbary Pirates • The First Naval War for Freedom (part 1)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KVh9HpNXRu4&amp;t\n\nAmerica vs Barbary Pirates • The First Naval War for Freedom (part 2)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Rw4ji9Iqvck\n\nPlease support: \nhttps://www.patreon.com/NabiAsli\nhttps://www.paypal.com/paypalme/nabiasli1\n\n𝐀𝐦𝐞𝐫𝐢𝐜𝐚 𝐯𝐬. 𝐁𝐚𝐫𝐛𝐚𝐫𝐲 𝐏𝐢𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐬 𝐏𝐚𝐫𝐭 𝟐: 𝐓𝐨 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐒𝐡𝐨𝐫𝐞𝐬 𝐨𝐟 𝐓𝐫𝐢𝐩𝐨𝐥��\nIn February 1804, the captured American frigate Philadelphia still sat in Tripoli harbor under Yusuf Karamanli’s guns. Lieutenant Stephen Decatur slipped in at night with a small crew, set the ship ablaze, and escaped—denying the Pasha a powerful warship and proving that American sailors could strike inside his own harbor.\nMonths later, with the naval blockade stalled, former consul William Eaton proposed a different kind of attack. He sailed to Alexandria, found Hamet Karamanli—Yusuf’s exiled older brother—and offered him American support to reclaim the throne. With a handful of Marines under Lieutenant Presley O’Bannon, Greek mercenaries, and hundreds of Arab fighters, Eaton marched nearly 600 miles across the Libyan desert.\nOn April 27, 1805, the expedition reached Derna. American ships bombarded the harbor battery while O’Bannon’s Marines and Greeks charged the walls. They took the fort, raised the 15-star American flag over foreign soil for the first time, and held the city against Yusuf’s counterattacks. For the first time, the Pasha faced a real threat on land as well as at sea.\nThe fall of Derna broke the stalemate. On June 10, 1805, Yusuf agreed to a peace treaty. American prisoners were released and tribute payments ended. The line “to the shores of Tripoli” entered the Marines’ Hymn, and the United States had shown it would fight rather than keep paying for safe passage.\nThis video follows the burning of the Philadelphia, Eaton’s search for Hamet, the desert march, the capture of Derna, and the treaty that followed."},{"id":"uICQwIAijjg","title":"Full video available now! #islam #hishamabuyusuf #fyp #nature #sunnah #allah #fyp #prophetmuhammad","channelId":"UC3_0GYlx_TGVdnr-6WtAlCw","channel":"Hisham Abu Yusuf","category":"Lectures & Islamic Studies","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T11:52:36+00:00","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/uICQwIAijjg/hqdefault.jpg","description":""},{"id":"HR2sH_eXZ_I","title":"Don't Let Pride Destroy Your Family Ties Before It's Too Late","channelId":"UCPubBVDCzu7IWWnitlkEsNw","channel":"Towards Eternity","category":"Dawah & Outreach","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T11:36:57+00:00","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/HR2sH_eXZ_I/hqdefault.jpg","description":"I want to donate to Towards Eternity;\n\n📎To support us, join this channel:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/channel/UCPubBVDCzu7IWWnitlkEsNw/join\n\n📎Our Apps: https://go.towardseternity.com/m/apps \n\n📎Our website: https://towardseternity.com/support/\n\n📎Our email address: info@towardseternity.com\n\n💌Follow us on Instagram;\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/towardseternity/\n\n4346r"},{"id":"UGUjUbDbkk8","title":"Islam me ye riwaj kha se ayaa😱🔥 | Islamic shorts #islam #shorts","channelId":"UCtemIBG_M2Ar68KQpBUudYQ","channel":"Islamic spidy","category":"Reminders & Spirituality","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T11:23:23+00:00","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/UGUjUbDbkk8/hqdefault.jpg","description":"This video is about islam and knowledge of muslims\n\n#islam #islamic #islamicstatus #muslim #quran #deen #islamicshorts #islamicknowledge #muslimah #quranverses #islamicreaction #islamicspidy"},{"id":"VvbzLGlOlqk","title":"Sponsored Segment. Subscribe at musletter.com #musletter #muslimworld #muslimnews #fyp #podcast","channelId":"UCWJPKXhkcMGXafdtqGx1mEw","channel":"The Thinking Muslim","category":"Lectures & Islamic Studies","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T11:21:01+00:00","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/VvbzLGlOlqk/hqdefault.jpg","description":""},{"id":"p4WBDBQBpyc","title":"what is God ? #God #Allah","channelId":"UCugkjL4OuDnO6CeKgRwk9yA","channel":"FivePillars OneMessage","category":"Dawah & Outreach","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T11:00:33+00:00","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/p4WBDBQBpyc/hqdefault.jpg","description":""},{"id":"F0wadj4A9Wk","title":"🛵 வண்டி Book அப்பறம் தரேன் | Tamil Islamic Shorts | @LEETVNetwork","channelId":"UCqhyqYLZzpgqmOXVjsM0lSw","channel":"LEE TV Network","category":"Documentaries & Media","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T10:49:08+00:00","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/F0wadj4A9Wk/hqdefault.jpg","description":"#shorts #shortsfeed #islamicstatus #tamilstatus"},{"id":"Akrk07ZgY5U","title":"Masha,Allah makkah live madina live #makkah #madina #shorts #hajjlive #shortvideo Ramadan #mecca","channelId":"UC4oufTDeHleH6krxe2g_zyQ","channel":"Holy kaaba Officialðð","category":"General Islamic","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T10:10:45+00:00","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Akrk07ZgY5U/hqdefault.jpg","description":""},{"id":"Zh6nExdISrY","title":"Masha,Allah makkah live madina live #makkah #madina #shorts #hajjlive #shortvideo Ramadan #mecca haj","channelId":"UC4oufTDeHleH6krxe2g_zyQ","channel":"Holy kaaba Officialðð","category":"General Islamic","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T10:00:22+00:00","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Zh6nExdISrY/hqdefault.jpg","description":""},{"id":"NTwJggpwplI","title":"The fastest way to destroy trust is to judge someone before you have heard their side.","channelId":"UClUa7-iHJNKEM2e_zWYSPQg","channel":"Yasir Qadhi","category":"Lectures & Islamic Studies","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T09:15:48+00:00","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/NTwJggpwplI/hqdefault.jpg","description":""},{"id":"mI1c2D4GOF0","title":"Nimrod Ki Aag Aur Hazrat Ibrahim AS  #nimrod #hazratibrahim #islamicshorts  #meenuislamicstories","channelId":"UCXI68k2eXdIuDyr0uo8CmGA","channel":"Meenu stories","category":"Documentaries & Media","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T09:00:01+00:00","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mI1c2D4GOF0/hqdefault.jpg","description":"Nimrod Ki Aag Aur Hazrat Ibrahim AS | Hairatangez Waqia\nNimrod Ki Aag Aur Hazrat Ibrahim AS | Hairatangez Waqia - In this video, we will explore the remarkable story of Hazrat Ibrahim AS, also known as Prophet Ibrahim, and his encounter with Nimrud's fire. This incredible event is a testament to the unwavering faith and courage of Hazrat Ibrahim, who is considered one of the most important prophets in Islam. The story of Hazrat Ibrahim ka waqia is a well-known one, and it highlights the prophet's unshakeable trust in Allah. As we delve into the life of Hazrat Ibrahim AS, we will also touch upon his relationship with Hazrat Ismail and the significance of Zamzam. This video is part of our series on Qasas ul Anbiya, where we share the stories of prophets and their remarkable experiences. By watching this video, you will gain a deeper understanding of the life and teachings of Prophet Ibrahim, also known as Hazrat Ibrahim or Prophet Abraham in Islam. The story of Ibrahim AS aag ka waqia is a fascinating one, and it serves as a reminder of the power of faith and the importance of standing up for what is right, just like Hazrat Ibrahim did. Our goal is to share Islamic stories in Urdu and Hindi, making them accessible to a wider audience, and to inspire our viewers with the stories of Anbiya ke qissay and Prophet Stories.\nEk Nabi (AS) ne apni qaum ke buton ko tor kar unki but-parasti ko challenge kiya. Qaum ne unhein aag mein daalne ka faisla kiya, lekin Allah Ta'ala ne aag ko hukm diya:\n\n&quot;Aye aag! Ibrahim par thandi aur salamati wali ban ja.&quot;\n\nYeh Hazrat Ibrahim (AS) ka waqia hai, jinhein Allah Ta'ala ne apna Khaleel banaya. Unki zindagi tawheed, sabr, qurbani aur Allah par bepanah bharose ki azeem misaal hai.\n\nIs video mein jaaniye Hazrat Ibrahim (AS) ki mukammal kahani, but-shikni ka waqia, aag ka imtihan, Namrood se mansoob waqia, Hazrat Hajar (RA) aur Hazrat Ismail (AS) ka Zamzam wala waqia, qurbani ka imtihan aur Khana Kaaba ki tameer.\n\n## 📖 IS VIDEO MEIN\n\n- Hazrat Ibrahim (AS) kaun the?\n- Tawheed ki talash aur shirk ki tardeed\n- Qaum ke but aur but-shikni ka waqia\n- Hazrat Ibrahim (AS) ko aag mein daalne ka waqia\n- Hazrat Ibrahim (AS) aur ek badshah ke darmiyan behas\n- Hazrat Hajar (RA), Hazrat Ismail (AS) aur Zamzam ka waqia\n- Qurbani ka azeem imtihan\n- Khana Kaaba ki tameer\n- Hazrat Ibrahim (AS) ki zindagi se hamare liye sabaq\n\n⏱️ TIMESTAMPS\n00:00 Intro\n00:59 Hazrat Ibrahim (AS) Kaun The?\n01:28 Tawheed Ki Talash\n04:33 Qaum Ke But Tor Diye\n09:04 Aag Ka Imtihan\n10:00 Kitne Log Iman Laye?\n12:04 Aaj Ke Logon Ke Liye Sabaq\n═══════════════════════════\n\n## 📚 QURAN &amp; HADITH REFERENCES\n\n### Quran Majeed\n\n1. Surah Al-Anbiya 21:51–70 — But-shikni aur aag ka waqia\n2. Surah Al-An'am 6:74–79 — Tawheed aur Allah ki nishaniyon par ghour\n3. Surah Al-Baqarah 2:258 — Hazrat Ibrahim (AS) aur ek badshah ke darmiyan behas\n4. Surah As-Saffat 37:99–111 — Qurbani ka imtihan\n5. Surah Al-Baqarah 2:124–129 — Imamat, Kaaba ki tameer aur duaein\n6. Surah An-Nisa 4:125 — Hazrat Ibrahim (AS), Allah ke Khaleel\n\n Sahih Ahadith\n\n- Sahih al-Bukhari — Hazrat Hajar (RA), Hazrat Ismail (AS) aur Zamzam ka waqia.\n- Sahih al-Bukhari — Hazrat Ibrahim (AS) aur Hazrat Ismail (AS) ke zariye Kaaba ki tameer.\n\n**Authenticity Note:** Quran mein us badshah ka naam Namrood nahi diya gaya. Namrood ke taur par uski pehchan tafseeri aur tareekhi riwayaat mein mashhoor hai. Isi tarah, jo tafseel Quran ya sahih hadith se sabit na ho, use yaqini haqeeqat ke taur par bayan karne ke bajaye riwayat ke hawale se bayan karna chahiye.\n\n═══════════════════════════\n\n ▶️ AGALI VIDEO\n\nHazrat Ayub (AS) Full Story | The Man Who Lost Everything &amp; Never Complained\n\nNext Video Link: [https://youtu.be/0u2gTzG5_44]\n\n MEENU ISLAMIC STORIES\n\nAnbiya-e-Kiram (AS) ke waqiat, Sahaba-e-Kiram (RA) ki zindagi aur Islamic history ke sabaq-amoz qisson ke liye **Meenu Islamic Stories** ko subscribe karein.\n\nVideo pasand aaye to like karein aur apne doston aur family ke saath share karein.\n\nQURIES:\n\nHazrat Ibrahim AS Full Story, Hazrat Ibrahim ka waqia, Prophet Ibrahim story Urdu Hindi, Hazrat Ibrahim aur Namrood, Ibrahim AS aag ka waqia, Hazrat Ibrahim but shikni, Hazrat Hajar aur Hazrat Ismail, Zamzam ka waqia, Khaleelullah, Prophet Abraham in Islam, Qasas ul Anbiya, Islamic stories in Urdu Hindi.\n\nحضرت ابراہیم علیہ السلام کا واقعہ | آگ کا واقعہ | خلیل اللہ | قصص الانبیاء | حضرت ابراہیم اور نمرود\n\nहज़रत इब्राहीम अलैहिस्सलाम का वाक़िया | ��ग का वाक़िया | ख़लीलुल्लाह | क़सस उल अंबिया\n\n#hazratibrahim   #qasasulanbiya   #prophetstories  #islamicstory  #islamicwaqia  #MeenuIslamicStories"},{"id":"bHmhbz_Za0Y","title":"What Is Ihsan? Worshiping Allah With Excellence","channelId":"UC4k6wpCaqzsJWv1i3u_a4mQ","channel":"Abu Ayoub Daud Burke | Ø£Ø¨Ù Ø£ÙÙØ¨ Ø¯Ø§ÙØ¯ Ø¨ÙØ±ÙÙ","category":"Dawah & Outreach","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T08:50:15+00:00","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/bHmhbz_Za0Y/hqdefault.jpg","description":"What is ihsan, and how does it relate to Islam and iman? Ustadh Daud Burke explains worship with excellence, humility, and awareness that Allah sees us, with a practical example of how being watched affects our work.\n\nFrom Lesson 3, covering Hadith 2, in Nawawi’s 40 Hadith with Ustadh Daud Burke.\n\nGet the Arabic–English translation used in the course (name your own price):\nhttps://flammespark.gumroad.com/l/forty-hadith-arabic-english\n\nStudy the course on Patreon:\nhttps://www.patreon.com/collection/2403039\n\nWatch the free introductory lesson:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x7N8lnd26kk\n\n#Shorts #Hadith #Islam"},{"id":"lxRZff_ndd8","title":"the bright moon rose over us 🌕","channelId":"UCIDYe6rgdROl77DDevNIcPA","channel":"MiniMus